{
  "id": "1CH.23",
  "number": "23",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Mambo Ya Nyakati 23",
  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "23",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi alipokuwa mzee wa miaka mingi, alimtawaza Solomoni mwanawe awe mfalme wa Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme Daudi aliwakusanya wakuu wote wa Israeli, makuhani na Walawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walawi wote wanaume wenye umri wa miaka thelathini na zaidi, wakahesabiwa. Jumla yao ilikuwa 38,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hao, Daudi aliwagawanya: 24,000 kati yao wawe wasimamizi wa kazi ya nyumbani kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu, 6,000 wawe maofisa na waamuzi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "4,000 wawe mabawabu, na 4,000 wawe waimbaji, wakimsifu Mwenyezi-Mungu kwa ala za muziki alizotengeneza mfalme mwenyewe kwa madhumuni hayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi aliwagawanya Walawi katika makundi matatu kulingana na koo za kabila la Lawi: Ukoo wa Gershoni, ukoo wa Kohathi na ukoo wa Merari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Gershoni walikuwa wawili: Ladani na Shimei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ladani alikuwa na wana watatu: Yehieli mkuu wao, Zethamu na Yoeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Shimei walikuwa watatu: Shelomithi, Hazieli na Harani. Hawa walikuwa viongozi wa ukoo wa Ladani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Shimei walikuwa viongozi wanne: Yahathi, Zina, Yeushi na Beria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahathi ndiye aliyekuwa mkuu wao, akifuatiwa na Ziza. Lakini Yeushi na Beria, kwa vile hawakuwa na wana wengi, walichukuliwa na ukoo mmoja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Kohathi walikuwa wanne: Amramu, Ishari, Hebroni na Uzieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Amramu walikuwa Aroni na Mose. Aroni aliteuliwa awe akiweka wakfu vyombo vitakatifu kabisa, pia wazawa wake daima wafukizie ubani mbele za Mwenyezi-Mungu, wakimtumikia na kuwabariki watu katika jina la Mwenyezi-Mungu milele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini wana wa Mose, mtu wa Mungu, hutajwa miongoni mwa kabila la Lawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Mose walikuwa Gershomu na Eliezeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliyekuwa mkuu miongoni mwa wana wa Gershomu ni Shebueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliezeri alikuwa na mwana mmoja tu; Rehabia, naye alikuwa kiongozi. Lakini Rehabia alikuwa na wana wengi sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishari alimzaa Shelomithi, kiongozi wa kabila zima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Hebroni walikuwa wanne: Mkuu wao alikuwa Yeria, wa pili Amaria, wa tatu Yahazieli na wa nne Yekameamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Uzieli walikuwa wawili: Mika mkuu wao, na Ishia wa pili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Merari alikuwa na wana wawili: Mali na Mushi. Wana wa Mali walikuwa wawili: Eleazari na Kishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eleazari alifariki bila kupata mtoto wa kiume, ila mabinti tu. Mabinti hao waliolewa na binamu zao, wana wa Kishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Mushi walikuwa watatu: Mali, Ederi na Yeremothi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hao ndio wana wa Lawi kulingana na koo zao. Kila mmoja wao aliyetimiza umri wa miaka ishirini na zaidi, aliandikishwa kwa jina, na alishiriki katika huduma ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi alisema, “Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa Israeli, amewapa watu wake amani, naye ataishi Yerusalemu milele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo, Walawi hawatahitaji tena kulibeba hema takatifu au vyombo vyake vya ibada.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulingana na maagizo ya mwisho aliyotoa Daudi, Walawi wote waliofikia umri wa miaka ishirini waliandikishwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini wajibu wao ulikuwa ni kuwasaidia makuhani wa ukoo wa Aroni katika huduma ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu; kuzitunza nyua na vyumba, kuvisafisha vyombo vitakatifu vyote na kufanya kazi zinazohusu huduma ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pamoja na hayo, walisaidia katika kazi ya mikate mitakatifu, unga mwembamba na sadaka ya nafaka, maandazi yasiyotiwa chachu, sadaka iliyookwa; sadaka iliyochanganywa na mafuta; pia sadaka katika kazi ya upimaji wa wingi wa sadaka na ukubwa wake ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na walisimama kumshukuru na kumsifu Mwenyezi-Mungu kila siku asubuhi na jioni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
